Leaf_Text_ViridianCall::
	.string "LEAF: {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Over here!$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianGreeting::
	.string "LEAF: My twin brother,\n"
	.string "finally on the road!\p"
	.string "MOM said you were getting\n"
	.string "ready. I had to come see you.$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianSabrina::
	.string "SABRINA! It's good to see you.\n"
	.string "Keeping him company?\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, try not to spend\n"
	.string "every date training!$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianSabrinaReply::
	.string "SABRINA: I know his habits.\n"
	.string "I've had years to learn them.$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianBadges::
	.string "LEAF opens her BADGE CASE.\n"
	.string "Two BADGES gleam inside.\p"
	.string "LEAF: The BOULDERBADGE\n"
	.string "and the CASCADEBADGE!\p"
	.string "BROCK and MISTY were tough.\n"
	.string "We had some great battles!\p"
	.string "Two in three months? I know.\n"
	.string "I'm taking the scenic route.$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianEevee::
	.string "There are people to meet\n"
	.string "and places to explore.\p"
	.string "EEVEE likes our little stops.\n"
	.string "I think you would, too.$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianFarewell::
	.string "Enjoy your journey, both of you!\n"
	.string "And keep in touch with MOM.\p"
	.string "I'll see you farther along.\n"
	.string "Don't forget to look around!$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianSabrinaFarewell::
	.string "SABRINA: Take care, LEAF.\n"
	.string "We will.$"
